MJPEG fixtures of the host tests (tests/mjpeg_stream.hpp loads them; the streams
themselves are assembled in the test code from these pieces).

tiny_16x16.jpg, tiny_32x16.jpg -- baseline 4:2:0 JPEGs, made once with:
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc=size=16x16:rate=1 -frames:v 1 -q:v 8 -pix_fmt yuvj420p -bitexact tiny_16x16.jpg
    ffmpeg -f lavfi -i testsrc=size=32x16:rate=1 -frames:v 1 -q:v 8 -pix_fmt yuvj420p -bitexact tiny_32x16.jpg
